WEBVTT

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:17.125
"I hereby give my permission to
turn Excel Saga into an animal show."

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:19.458
Shall we go with lots of animals today?

00:00:24.708 --> 00:00:25.875
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:40.500
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.417
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:52.292
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:00:52.292 --> 00:00:56.167
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:00:56.167 --> 00:01:00.250
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:07.958
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:12.708
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:16.750
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.667
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:23.875
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:26.042
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:26.042 --> 00:01:27.958
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:29.833
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:31.750
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:36.583
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:39.708
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:44.292
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:52.167
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:20.708
"Dirt Wall of Hope" "Difficult Wall Foundation"
"Heat/Sound Insulation Material" "Home stretch"

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:23.750
"Freedom"

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.750
"Steel Shelves of Despair"

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.583
"Today's Menchi's Escape Plan"

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:27.875
"Today's Menchi's Escape Plan"
"...Probably Failed"

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.250
Mistress Excel has returned!

00:02:36.458 --> 00:02:38.458
What? Did you have the key, Hatchan?

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.917
Oh, I'll get it out right away.

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:45.958
I'm home! Menchi,

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.958
have you been energetically
trying to fatten up today too?

00:02:51.958 --> 00:02:54.125
So, you've been running out
of breath, foaming at the mouth,

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:56.375
and generally having
a lot of time on your hands.

00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:59.167
Bad girl, if you exercise too much,

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:02.000
your meat will get hard
and you won't taste as good.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.625
Senior, I will start preparing dinner.

00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:07.750
Besides, if you played
too much and lost weight,

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:08.792
it'd be a total loss.

00:03:08.792 --> 00:03:10.875
Menchi, you don't belong to just yourself.

00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:13.250
If you try hard, you might even multiply.

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.500
If you try hard, you'll multiply!
If you try hard, you'll multiply!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.042
If you try hard, you'll multiply!
If you try hard, you'll multiply!

00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:18.833
If you try hard, you'll multiply!

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:21.167
What a wonderful prospective
view of the future.

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:26.375
What's wrong, Menchi?!

00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:29.958
Though it seems like some
naïve part of your heart just broke!

00:03:30.708 --> 00:03:32.167
I'm done!

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:33.167
Done.

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.208
And so,

00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:37.208
in order to obtain funds for our
ideological organization, ACROSS,

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:39.750
we'll be going to work part-time
at a nearby convenience store.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.500
So, once again, please watch
the place while we're gone.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.833
Please.

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:44.833
"Chance!"

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:50.917
"Fresh Plaster"  "Caution"

00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:55.833
"Fresh Plaster"  "Caution"
"Freedom"

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.875
"Fresh Plaster"  "Caution"

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:06.208
You can't eat your food? Poor thing.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.375
"Menchi's Memories"

00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:11.625
Really, young people these days...

00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:15.208
How could they give a puppy
such heavily seasoned food?

00:04:15.208 --> 00:04:17.875
Here, eat this.

00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:21.792
And this doghouse isn't
done right either! Sheesh.

00:04:21.792 --> 00:04:26.292
Back when my wife and son
were alive, I'd have to do this a lot.

00:04:26.292 --> 00:04:28.542
Really, I haven't done this in so long.

00:04:28.542 --> 00:04:33.208
Right, how long has
it been since I was left alone?

00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:38.208
Why am I telling you all this?

00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:41.083
I guess it means that I've grown old.

00:04:44.625 --> 00:04:46.583
Get picked up by a
good person, you hear?

00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:47.250
"Shiroinu Yamako Movers"

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.708
I wanted to stay with you forever,
but I don't have long to live.

00:04:50.708 --> 00:04:54.500
I'm sure there's someone
more worthy of you than me.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.250
I wish you happiness.

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:02.208
Take care!

00:05:08.042 --> 00:05:10.833
"Menchi's Memories"
"Fin"

00:05:12.917 --> 00:05:16.333
Come on, don't get so mad.
I just picked it up.

00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:19.458
You bastard! How could
you <i>just </i>pick up the money

00:05:19.458 --> 00:05:23.292
from a wallet on a desk in my room?!

00:05:23.292 --> 00:05:27.583
Well, those are the things
the blood of justice enables you...

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.167
What justice?! You super-villain!

00:05:31.167 --> 00:05:33.125
All that for 270 yen...

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:37.208
You idiot! That was my
entire fortune until tomorrow!

00:05:41.042 --> 00:05:41.958
"Could this be..."

00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:44.000
"Could this be..."
"Freedom"

00:05:55.083 --> 00:05:59.583
"Freedom... So, it means for
your heart to have wings..."

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:04.417
And then? What happened next?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.083
"You are here"

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.667
Oh, it's a woof-woof!

00:06:13.667 --> 00:06:15.208
Don't go near it.

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:16.667
Why not?

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:18.250
Look, it doesn't have a collar.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.250
That means it doesn't have an owner.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.250
It might have some scary diseases.

00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:26.500
"No, I don't!"

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.792
Yumi hates diseases.

00:06:28.792 --> 00:06:31.708
You see? From now on,
look for meow-meows, not woof-woofs.

00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:33.875
Yeah! Yumi loves meow-meows!

00:06:33.875 --> 00:06:36.000
"But I don't have any diseases..."

00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:43.458
I'm a mean brat, a mean brat!

00:06:43.458 --> 00:06:46.708
A young demon that
sold himself to the Devil.

00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:52.625
Damn, cocky bastard.
How about this?!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.167
You're just a dog. All right!

00:07:04.042 --> 00:07:07.042
Stop, damn you!

00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:20.667
This one's more fun than the dog!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.708
Is it dead? Is it dead?

00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:25.750
Taste divine retribution!

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.250
I wish you happiness.

00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:46.833
What the hell is this?!

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:48.417
Who did this?!

00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:51.750
Is this the state's plot to
interfere with ACROSS's ideology?!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.292
In any case, Will-<i>chan</i>, reset the door!

00:07:54.292 --> 00:07:57.417
I'm the Macrocosm,
yet I'm stuck fixing doors.

00:07:57.417 --> 00:07:59.750
My, what an unsightly way to die.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.000
"Ain't dead"
I'd never want to imitate him.

00:08:04.542 --> 00:08:07.083
Setting aside the
boiling mystery creature,

00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:09.875
where did the original
emergency food supply go?

00:08:09.875 --> 00:08:10.792
Could it be?!

00:08:10.792 --> 00:08:12.917
Is this mystery creature
the disfigured sight of Menchi,

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:14.708
due to being boiled?

00:08:14.708 --> 00:08:16.792
Could it be an upgraded version?
Could it? Could it?

00:08:16.792 --> 00:08:19.083
But I feel like there are pasts that
I don't want to remember

00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:22.625
where I met this creature in
the story a couple times so far.

00:08:22.625 --> 00:08:24.500
Well, if we can eat it in
an emergency, that's that.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.917
It'll be okay if it's a
little chewy and for flavoring...

00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:29.625
And I'm saying that
it's totally meaningless!

00:08:29.625 --> 00:08:31.375
I'm gonna get fried, you idiot!

00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:31.958
"Ain't dead"

00:08:31.958 --> 00:08:35.125
So, this is what people
become like when they die.

00:08:35.125 --> 00:08:37.208
The sole of his foot is pungent...

00:08:37.208 --> 00:08:41.125
I don't know what's what!
Tell me, me! Answer me, you!

00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:43.917
Sweet and bitter experiences
are both coming soon!

00:09:07.333 --> 00:09:09.000
Who are you?!

00:09:09.958 --> 00:09:15.167
Don't sneak into people's homes
without permission, you brat!

00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:17.708
Because of dogs like you,
dogs like me, who take our role

00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:22.500
as faithful dogs seriously,
are treated as bothersome by humans!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.708
Say something.

00:09:24.708 --> 00:09:26.042
Come on!

00:09:28.333 --> 00:09:29.333
"Shock"

00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:38.875
Leave it at that.

00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:43.208
You blocked my paw-fist
with your bare paw...

00:09:43.208 --> 00:09:44.250
When in the world?

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.875
If we're fighting seriously,
I don't pull my punches.

00:09:46.875 --> 00:09:49.000
That's the kind of dog I am.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.167
Let's go, white one.

00:09:55.417 --> 00:09:57.083
Are you hurt?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.583
My name is Takahashi.

00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:04.083
The nickname the director gave
me is Wolf. What about you?

00:10:04.083 --> 00:10:07.250
Menchi? Sounds like some kind of food.

00:10:09.458 --> 00:10:11.458
I'm not trying to make fun of you.

00:10:11.458 --> 00:10:14.208
Come on, Menchi. You're hungry, right?

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.583
It's this way.

00:10:25.542 --> 00:10:28.167
Don't worry, they're my friends.

00:10:28.167 --> 00:10:30.833
Wolf, who's that?

00:10:30.833 --> 00:10:35.417
Well, due to circumstances,
Menchi will be staying with us tonight.

00:10:35.417 --> 00:10:36.875
You serious?

00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:38.917
We're already short on food,

00:10:38.917 --> 00:10:41.250
and you brought in more dead weight?

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:45.042
What are you talking about?
You're quite a drag yourself.

00:10:45.042 --> 00:10:47.583
Damn, snake eyes.

00:10:47.583 --> 00:10:50.083
I welcome Miss Menchi.

00:10:50.083 --> 00:10:53.792
Quite obviously, we should help
one another in times of trouble.

00:10:53.792 --> 00:10:57.125
Man, what a beautiful friendship!

00:10:57.125 --> 00:10:59.958
I'm just so moved!

00:10:59.958 --> 00:11:03.625
They're all kind of fussy,
but they're not a bad bunch.

00:11:03.625 --> 00:11:06.000
Kyoko, dinner for six tonight.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:07.167
Okay!

00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:09.917
You're a girl, right?
Would you help me?

00:11:12.125 --> 00:11:14.583
She better not be an agent
of the Animal Control Department.

00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:16.458
You should watch your habit

00:11:16.458 --> 00:11:18.875
of immediately becoming
suspicious of others.

00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:21.542
That's just like you, Professor.
You say some good things.

00:11:21.542 --> 00:11:22.833
She was sort of...

00:11:22.833 --> 00:11:25.417
Her eyes had this sort
of tormented look in them,

00:11:25.417 --> 00:11:27.625
and I just couldn't leave her alone.

00:11:29.375 --> 00:11:31.125
"Thanks for the food."

00:11:32.042 --> 00:11:36.167
So you escaped
from your terrifying owner,

00:11:36.167 --> 00:11:39.375
and you want to
go back to the kind old man.

00:11:39.375 --> 00:11:43.042
Man, that's a tearjerker!
You're very admirable, Menchi!

00:11:43.042 --> 00:11:47.875
Menchi, is the old man's
house near here?

00:11:47.875 --> 00:11:51.000
I see, so he's somewhere
in these mountains.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:55.667
Say, let's all get together
and find this old man for Menchi.

00:11:55.667 --> 00:11:57.583
I'll work hard!

00:11:57.583 --> 00:11:59.500
I don't have any objections.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.833
Damn, I couldn't stand
doing something like that.

00:12:01.833 --> 00:12:04.333
Then I guess you'll
stay and watch the fort.

00:12:04.333 --> 00:12:08.458
Hey, hey, that ain't fair!
I'll go. I'll go, all right?

00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:30.542
"I have friends to rub paws with."
"I'm happy with that for now..." "This is good..."

00:12:43.625 --> 00:12:45.958
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:12:45.958 --> 00:12:47.083
Zzo...

00:12:47.083 --> 00:12:50.208
It's good that you are
always energetic, but Excel,

00:12:50.208 --> 00:12:54.167
let's hear your reason for being late
to our regular meeting time.

00:12:54.167 --> 00:12:57.708
Clearly, concisely,
and in under 200 spaces.

00:12:57.708 --> 00:13:00.250
Yes, Sir! Actually, I,
the combat captain-ish person

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.625
in the ideological
organization of ACROSS,

00:13:02.625 --> 00:13:05.667
have an emergency food supply
called Menchi, who is missing,

00:13:05.667 --> 00:13:07.917
and the time used
to investigate and pursue

00:13:07.917 --> 00:13:09.917
this situation went over and beyond.

00:13:09.917 --> 00:13:11.250
That must be terrible for you.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:15.417
Oh, it is! Without Menchi,
the basis of our daily lives...

00:13:15.417 --> 00:13:16.833
Two hundred...

00:13:18.417 --> 00:13:21.083
Snake! Snake, snake, snake,
heavyweight!

00:13:21.083 --> 00:13:22.542
Please excuse me now!

00:13:22.542 --> 00:13:23.958
You must be worried.

00:13:23.958 --> 00:13:26.583
Yes. Miss Menchi--

00:13:26.583 --> 00:13:28.917
Won't you try worrying about me too?!

00:13:32.167 --> 00:13:34.042
Wait just a little longer, okay?

00:13:34.042 --> 00:13:36.583
Taikomochi will be
back from scouting soon.

00:13:36.583 --> 00:13:39.583
This area's become
dangerous these days.

00:13:39.583 --> 00:13:41.458
I heard that the
Animal Control Department

00:13:41.458 --> 00:13:44.625
even established a
special unit to hunt stray dogs.

00:13:44.625 --> 00:13:47.000
Looks like he's back.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:47.917
Well?

00:13:47.917 --> 00:13:50.708
It seems there won't be
any patrols during the morning.

00:13:50.708 --> 00:13:52.708
Man, aren't we lucky?

00:13:52.708 --> 00:13:57.625
All right, let's get moving!
It'll be tough, but you with me?

00:13:58.625 --> 00:13:59.792
Inchiki?

00:13:59.792 --> 00:14:01.167
I know.

00:14:03.958 --> 00:14:07.042
Damn, a four-two. This is bad.

00:14:14.875 --> 00:14:16.458
It's that way.

00:14:16.458 --> 00:14:21.042
Oh my, what good weather it is!
Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!

00:14:27.417 --> 00:14:28.833
This way!

00:14:32.542 --> 00:14:33.583
"OX Animal Control Department"

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.375
What?

00:14:35.375 --> 00:14:37.167
This wasn't what my info said!

00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:39.000
On top of that, those dogs
are the ones causing a stir

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.875
on the “Bow-wow Stray Dog
Communication Network”!

00:14:41.875 --> 00:14:44.042
The Animal Control Department's
anti-stray dog team!

00:14:44.042 --> 00:14:46.417
Commonly known as the Hounds!

00:14:47.292 --> 00:14:48.542
"Mad Spot (Previous Boss)"

00:14:48.542 --> 00:14:51.250
Th-That's Mad Spot!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.667
So, Wolf, you've finally
revealed yourself.

00:14:53.667 --> 00:14:56.167
Why? Once, long ago,

00:14:56.167 --> 00:14:58.917
you were a good woof-woof,
full of pride and friendship!

00:14:58.917 --> 00:15:00.833
So why are you doing this now?!

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:05.208
I had a revelation
about my true nature as a dog.

00:15:05.208 --> 00:15:07.875
A dog is a dog because
he serves humans.

00:15:07.875 --> 00:15:11.750
In the end, a stray dog is
an outsider as a dog.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.542
Bastard! You've made
a deal with the humans!

00:15:14.542 --> 00:15:17.875
A deal? What an
indecent thing to suggest.

00:15:17.875 --> 00:15:22.417
I only demanded to be justly
compensated for my work.

00:15:22.417 --> 00:15:24.042
In other words,

00:15:24.042 --> 00:15:27.875
control over the
dog society in this town.

00:15:27.875 --> 00:15:31.375
You'll get hurt if you
keep up that sassy talk!

00:15:34.042 --> 00:15:36.417
Now's our chance! Run for it!

00:15:40.875 --> 00:15:42.042
Inchiki!

00:15:42.042 --> 00:15:45.750
I'll take care of this somehow!
You guys run!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.792
You're crazy!

00:15:46.792 --> 00:15:48.125
Go!

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.083
Let's go!

00:15:51.083 --> 00:15:51.667
--But...

00:15:51.667 --> 00:15:53.917
--Don't let his effort go to waste!
--But...

00:15:54.792 --> 00:15:56.125
Menchi!

00:16:00.125 --> 00:16:02.458
Keep him alive.

00:16:02.458 --> 00:16:06.292
After them! Capture them,
no matter what!

00:16:06.292 --> 00:16:08.292
No matter what.

00:16:10.833 --> 00:16:12.958
Inchiki, I'm sorry.

00:16:12.958 --> 00:16:14.458
It couldn't be helped.

00:16:14.458 --> 00:16:18.750
If someone hadn't done that,
we would have all been caught.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:21.500
Professor, don't you feel anything?!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.750
Inchiki got caught to save us!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.208
I know that.

00:16:27.208 --> 00:16:29.292
But it was the correct decision.

00:16:32.833 --> 00:16:35.917
I'm sorry, you and Inchiki were true...

00:16:35.917 --> 00:16:37.833
No, it's okay.

00:16:37.833 --> 00:16:38.833
Let's go.

00:16:38.833 --> 00:16:42.375
We've got to deliver Menchi
to the old man, no matter what!

00:16:43.167 --> 00:16:47.958
Don't let it bother you.
Inchiki would have wanted it this way.

00:16:47.958 --> 00:16:49.083
Besides...

00:16:49.083 --> 00:16:52.625
Even now, there's something
that I can do for someone else.

00:16:52.625 --> 00:16:54.417
That fact makes me happy.

00:16:54.417 --> 00:16:55.958
Me too, man.

00:16:55.958 --> 00:16:57.125
I too.

00:16:57.125 --> 00:16:58.792
That's how it is.

00:17:03.875 --> 00:17:04.833
--Here they come!

00:17:04.833 --> 00:17:06.583
--Let us run!
--Here they come!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.917
Come on, Taikomochi!

00:17:08.917 --> 00:17:12.667
I'm scared, but I'll
buy you some time here!

00:17:12.667 --> 00:17:16.000
It'll be all right.
I'll pull through with my cheer.

00:17:16.833 --> 00:17:20.583
Mr. Fire Brigadiers,
I'll rough you up a little!

00:17:20.583 --> 00:17:21.792
Don't do it!

00:17:21.792 --> 00:17:23.458
Taikomochi!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.042
This tea has taurine in it, doesn't it?

00:17:31.833 --> 00:17:33.500
According to our information,

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:37.000
an old man lives alone
in the house beyond this hole.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.500
All right.

00:17:43.917 --> 00:17:45.167
Professor?!

00:17:45.167 --> 00:17:47.542
My job is done.

00:17:47.542 --> 00:17:48.792
What are you talking about?!

00:17:48.792 --> 00:17:50.833
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:50.833 --> 00:17:52.833
You must not lose sight
of the bigger picture

00:17:52.833 --> 00:17:54.583
due to a moment of sentimentality.

00:17:54.583 --> 00:17:56.708
That bomb is a parting gift from me.

00:17:56.708 --> 00:17:58.375
Now, please go.

00:18:00.042 --> 00:18:05.208
Miss Menchi, I do not want you
to become a dog like me.

00:18:05.208 --> 00:18:09.042
That is why I can put my life on the line.

00:18:10.042 --> 00:18:14.250
Come, I shall show you
the power of a well-read dog!

00:18:17.375 --> 00:18:19.625
Inchiki!

00:18:21.875 --> 00:18:23.875
Professor!

00:18:34.375 --> 00:18:36.750
So, this is it. Are you sure?

00:18:39.958 --> 00:18:41.417
Now, go.

00:18:41.417 --> 00:18:42.417
Hurry.

00:18:42.417 --> 00:18:44.625
Don't worry about the rest.

00:18:45.542 --> 00:18:47.750
I hope you'll be happy with him.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.583
Kyoko!

00:18:59.917 --> 00:19:01.583
Who's there?!

00:19:05.083 --> 00:19:07.750
Inchiki! Why?! Why are you here?!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.917
It's not like I betrayed you or anything.

00:19:10.917 --> 00:19:13.417
I was on this side from the beginning.

00:19:13.417 --> 00:19:16.792
In other words, my job
was to infiltrate and investigate.

00:19:16.792 --> 00:19:21.417
Think about it. How did
they know where you were going?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.333
Are you saying that your
leading us here was a trick?!

00:19:25.333 --> 00:19:26.958
Exactly.

00:19:26.958 --> 00:19:30.708
You guys sure are trusting
not to notice it until now.

00:19:30.708 --> 00:19:31.667
--Bastard!

00:19:31.667 --> 00:19:33.958
--Not so fast!
--Bastard!

00:19:33.958 --> 00:19:36.958
That's right, the climax is still to come.

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:47.792
M-Menchi...

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.917
Don't tell me that human is...

00:20:00.417 --> 00:20:01.833
Menchi...

00:20:01.833 --> 00:20:05.375
How far will you go,
toying with her canine feelings?!

00:20:05.375 --> 00:20:10.000
I had a feeling you'd
definitely help that female pup.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:14.042
After all, your kid sister was
about that age when I killed her.

00:20:14.042 --> 00:20:16.042
Damn you!

00:20:23.792 --> 00:20:25.875
Small fry should just stay quiet!

00:20:31.667 --> 00:20:34.708
So you still have the strength to stand.

00:20:34.708 --> 00:20:37.917
But your legend ends today.

00:20:37.917 --> 00:20:41.958
From now on, it'll be...
It'll be <i>my </i>era!

00:20:44.167 --> 00:20:47.250
If you're going to dream,
do it in your sleep, you stupid dog!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.917
Now, Old Man!

00:20:51.333 --> 00:20:53.208
Kyoko, can you make it?

00:20:53.208 --> 00:20:54.458
D-Dear...

00:20:54.458 --> 00:20:55.958
Let's go!

00:20:56.208 --> 00:20:57.750
What are you...

00:21:11.583 --> 00:21:14.250
A marriage registration?

00:21:16.333 --> 00:21:19.000
Right, I'm Kumikumi,
the mountain girl.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.333
Mahogany!

00:21:20.333 --> 00:21:22.417
You left your soup again?! Hey!

00:21:23.542 --> 00:21:24.917
P-Please calm down!

00:21:24.917 --> 00:21:27.708
You took my woman!
How dare you tell me to calm down?!

00:21:27.708 --> 00:21:29.417
So, I'm saying...

00:21:29.417 --> 00:21:31.583
That's “I'm sorry,” right?! Hey?!

00:21:32.333 --> 00:21:35.708
No!

00:21:40.583 --> 00:21:42.750
P-Please don't.

00:21:43.708 --> 00:21:47.083
They threatened me!

00:21:47.083 --> 00:21:50.958
Th-They said they'd kill me
if I didn't do what they said.

00:21:50.958 --> 00:21:55.125
P-Please, spare me. No...

00:21:55.125 --> 00:21:57.458
I don't want to die!

00:22:01.958 --> 00:22:05.542
"Episode 10: Menchi's Great Adventure"

00:22:05.542 --> 00:22:07.458
"Episode 10: Menchi's Great Adventure"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:07.458 --> 00:22:09.125
"Episode 10: Menchi's Great Adventure"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:10.958 --> 00:22:13.958
Aren't you glad
Miss Menchi came back?

00:22:13.958 --> 00:22:17.458
Yeah. I feel our future
is much more secure now.

00:22:17.458 --> 00:22:20.667
By the way, is that machinegun-looking
thing yours, Hatchan?

00:22:20.667 --> 00:22:21.917
No...

00:22:25.042 --> 00:22:27.750
"Elegy to the Dogs"

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:30.083
"Elegy to the Dogs"
"...Now That Succeeded"

00:22:50.917 --> 00:22:59.333
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.333 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:14.833 --> 00:23:23.625
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.583 --> 00:23:32.375
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.375 --> 00:23:40.250
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.125
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:56.875
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.125 --> 00:24:00.917
When you think of school,
what do you remember? Bullying?

00:24:00.917 --> 00:24:02.417
The cigarette you smoked behind
the school your freshman year?

00:24:02.417 --> 00:24:04.375
A group boycott of class? That sweet
moment in the PE storage room?

00:24:04.375 --> 00:24:05.500
All of that is bad, bad! It's unclean!

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:06.667
Your teacher won't
let you get away with it!

00:24:06.667 --> 00:24:09.583
The youth who will support the
future of ACROSS must be clean!

00:24:09.583 --> 00:24:11.667
So, lesson one!
Don't pull your nose hairs!

00:24:11.667 --> 00:24:13.667
Lesson two! Girls' sportswear
should uniformly be gym shorts!

00:24:13.667 --> 00:24:14.750
Lesson three!
Always watch midnight anime!

00:24:14.750 --> 00:24:16.375
Lesson four and beyond will be
omitted since we don't have time!

00:24:16.375 --> 00:24:18.875
Anyway, just live!
Got it, you good-for-nothings?!

00:24:18.875 --> 00:24:20.917
We'll just keep churning
out controversial statements!

00:24:20.917 --> 00:24:22.292
Quack Experimental Anime, Excel Saga!

00:24:22.292 --> 00:24:23.542
Next time: “Butt Out, Youth!”

00:24:23.542 --> 00:24:25.167
You know, you can get away
with anything when you're young.

00:24:25.167 --> 00:24:28.594
However, the average age
of our staff is over thirty!
